From e337cf48f164d3fa6f7e4b4d3304b36d64fcdac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Venkata Kota <venkata.kota@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:37:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] nord: update hpass dynamic modules for SA8797P-Ride-Embedded
 platform

Update HPASS dynamic modules for SA8797P-Ride-Embedded platform.
Fixes below were updated.
-- Moved to the mainline HPASS Version
-- Propagate driver start failure to the framework
-- Nord: VoNR not entering island beacuse of power mode
-- Enable LF variant on mainline
-- MISRA violations on Audio

Only the WHENCE and config.txt changes are kept, rebased onto the
20261019 release (the upstream commit sits on top of the config.txt
Machine:/Reuse: rework). The 00032-NORD-1 binaries are fetched from the
upstream commit as a separate source by the recipe.

Signed-off-by: Venkata Kota <venkata.kota@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/linux-msm/dsp-binaries/commit/29ba5422bfd4ee595360738f8f62c3394ad1c146]
---
 WHENCE     | 2 ++
 config.txt | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/WHENCE b/WHENCE
index 24bee7c..6fdb6d6 100644
--- a/WHENCE
+++ b/WHENCE
@@ -65,7 +65,9 @@ Status: Redistributable
 
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Dir: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/adsp-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00003-NORD-6
+Dir: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/adsp-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00032-NORD-1
 Dir: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/adsp1-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00003-NORD-6
+Dir: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/adsp1-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00032-NORD-1
 Dir: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/cdsp-NSP.AT.1.0-00579-NORD-1
 Device: Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. SA8797P Ride Embedded
 Licence: LICENSE.qcom-2
diff --git a/config.txt b/config.txt
index c643f61..dfc8aff 100644
--- a/config.txt
+++ b/config.txt
@@ -38,8 +38,8 @@ Install: maili/Qualcomm/Maili-MTP	adsp	LPAIDSP.HT.1.6-00701.4-HAWI-3
 Link: hawi/Qualcomm/Hawi-MTP/dsp/cdsp	maili/Qualcomm/Maili-MTP/dsp/cdsp
 
 # SA8797P Ride Embedded
-Install: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded	adsp	adsp-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00003-NORD-6
-Install: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded	adsp1	adsp1-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00003-NORD-6
+Install: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded	adsp	adsp-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00032-NORD-1
+Install: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded	adsp1	adsp1-HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00032-NORD-1
 Install: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded	cdsp	cdsp-NSP.AT.1.0-00579-NORD-1
 
 # Arduino Imola
